# IDP Estate Installer

This package installs the IDP Estate bootstrap tools and services.

## What's installed

- **`/usr/local/bin/idp-install-all`** — One-shot estate bootstrap script
- **`ai.estate.fleetview-backend`** — Launchd agent for the FleetView voice backend

## After installation

Run the full bootstrap:

    /usr/local/bin/idp-install-all

This installs Python 3.12, MacPorts (if missing), all Python packages, and
configures the launchd agents.

## More information

See: https://github.com/chidionyema/idp
